		<p><strong>GoDaddy</strong> is the world&apos;s largest domain registrar and one of the first places that people think about when getting a domain name. In addition to domain names, GoDaddy offers hosting, email, and a powerful website builder.</p>

		<p>GoDaddy also <a href="https://aboutus.godaddy.net/investor-relations/esg/environmental-impact/">cares about environmental sustainability</a> by:</p>
		<ul>
			<li>Powering offices and data centers with renewable energy (in some regions)</li>
			<li>Measuring and reducing their carbon footprint</li>
			<li>Publishing an annual sustainability report</li>
			<li>Engaging employees in energy efficiency, water conservation, and recycling programs</li>
		</ul>
	</div>
</div>

